{"id":"zhertva","lemma":"жертва","pos":"noun","rank":777,"glosses":["sacrifice","victim","casualty"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/19/Ru-%D0%B6%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%B6%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"жертвы","plural":"жертвы"},"examples":[{"text":"Мы оба пошли на жертвы.","en":"We've both made sacrifices.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"both"},{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"},{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Она не жертва.","en":"She is not the victim.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Вы жертва системы.","en":"You're a victim of the system.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,{"g":"system","l":"система"}]},{"text":"Где жертвы?","en":"Where are the victims?","words":[{"g":"where"},null]},{"text":"Том, может быть, не единственная жертва.","en":"Tom may not be the only victim.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"sole, only, unique","l":"единственный"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"maybe"]]}]}